Author: Nick Hung <nick@andestech.com>
Date:   Fri Jun 12 10:41:23 2026 +0800

    behavioral: run --verify -- oracle cross-check on the hybrid model (F4)

    `andes-sim run --model hybrid --trigger marker|pc --verify` (default off)
    runs a one-step oracle plan after the main run -- pure QEMU on a fresh
    mmap, draining at the ROI exit sampled at vsim's halt pc -- and diffs the
    two drained records in-process (PhaseResult now carries the full
    hybrid_state_v1). Mismatches print as [state-diff] lines and the run
    exits non-zero. --verify with fast/cycle or --trigger icount is a usage
    error.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

